--- nn.rng and nn.data held to torch's CPU generator in both modes
--- (held_rng.co's and held_data.co's checks): the words, the
--- permutations, the ints, the uniforms, the normals cached and filled,
--- Bernoulli, exponential and multinomial draws, and the loaders', the
--- samplers' and random_split's positions, compiled as interpreted
